data = SparseArray[coords[[All, {1, 2}]] -> coords[[All, 3]]];

ArrayPlot[data, ColorFunction -> "TemperatureMap", Mesh -> True]
```

If you want the values shown on top of the heatmap, overlay text:

```wl
