```wl
myFunc[arg1_, arg2_, arg3_] := Module[{local1, local2},
  local1 = (* routine 1 *);
  local2 = (* routine 2 *);
  (* routine 3 *);
  local2
]
```

Use `_` after each argument name to make it an input pattern.

Example:

```wl
