Read the file as a string, then remove lines that start with comment markers.

In Wolfram Language:

```wl
str = Import["file.csv", "Text"];
clean = StringReplace[str, Shortest[StartOfLine ~~ ("#" | "@") ~~ ___ ~~ EndOfLine] :> ""];
```

If comments are whole lines and you want to delete them before parsing CSV:

```wl
lines = StringSplit[str, "\n"];
lines = DeleteCases[lines, _?(StringMatchQ[#, ("#" ~~ ___) | ("@" ~~ ___)] &)];
clean = StringRiffle[lines, "\n"];
data = ImportString[clean, "CSV"];
