Use `SetSharedFunction[f]` before running the parallel evaluation.

Example:

```wl
f[1] = 1;
f[n_] := f[n] = f[n - 1] n;
SetSharedFunction[f];

ParallelTable[f[i], {i, 10}];
?f
```

This makes the master kernel collect the downvalues generated on subkernels, so `f` in the main kernel will show the computed cache.

