A better pattern is to build a dispatch table once and reuse it:

```mathematica
ClearAll[elem];
elem[chem_, element_] :=
  With[{dispatchTable = Dispatch[Thread[elements -> chem]]},
    elem[chem, el_] := el /. dispatchTable;
    elem[chem, element]
  ];
