Also, don’t define public functions after `Begin["`Private`"]` using `TestPackage\`` context. The usual pattern is:

```mathematica
BeginPackage["TestPackage`"];
f::usage = "My function";

Begin["`Private`"];

Mesg := Print["Private function of TestPackage"];
f[x_] := Module[{a = 3, b = 3}, Mesg; a x^b];

End[];
EndPackage[];
```

Then load it with:

```mathematica
