Use `NMinimize`/`FindMinimum` on an error function that wraps `NDSolve`.

Typical pattern:

```wl
fitFunc[r0_?NumericQ, r1_?NumericQ, c1_?NumericQ, off_?NumericQ] := Module[
  {sol, model, err},
  sol = NDSolve[{
      (* your ODEs with parameters r0,r1,c1,off *)
      (* initial conditions *)
    },
    vars, {t, tmin, tmax}
  ];

  model[t_] := Evaluate[(* expression from sol *)];
  err = Total[(model /@ times - (currData + off))^2];
  err
]
```

Then optimize:

```wl
