  fitFunc[r0, r1, c1, off],
  {{r0, r0init}, {r1, r1init}, {c1, c1init}, {off, offinit}}
]
```

Important:
- Use `?NumericQ` in `fitFunc` so `NMinimize` can evaluate it numerically.
- Better, solve once symbolically if possible: `DSolve`/`ParametricNDSolve` may be much faster.
